.TH RKMON 1 "" "rkmon" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rkmon \- terminal monitor for Rockchip RK3588 boards
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rkmon
[\fB\-i\fR \fIsec\fR] [\fB\-\-log\fR \fIfile.csv\fR] [\fB\-\-temp\-warn\fR \fIC\fR] [\fB\-\-temp\-crit\fR \fIC\fR] [\fB\-V\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows per-core CPU load and frequency, RKNPU load, GPU load, memory usage and
thermal zones with colored bars and history sparklines.
NPU load is read from debugfs and requires root.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B q
quit
.TP
.B + / \-
change refresh interval
.TP
.B c
toggle per-core CPU rows
.TP
.B p
pause
.SH FILES
/sys/kernel/debug/rknpu/load, /sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone*, /sys/class/devfreq/*, /proc/stat, /proc/meminfo
